6393090_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=kx4Vgs64GsgQ7kNvwFkECPl&_nc_oc=AdkPm83RlbQTNYGjhk99_UzMhyoieVFch77Ia7rUedPXrOVCuhubFxp5cdTLdfJx7YQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfxSvkc7q0LWZ_iOHkpa5ZI8MTWgg2i6y9zp_-nj5qDznw&oe=69BE9676"}, {"file_name": "magiclab.png", "id": "571678028809339", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982452_571678032142672_4802457235566616749_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=mJqhBMqj5BIQ7kNvwEOaOqY&_nc_oc=AdkXItVrANDC7h2wxBeAEnlfUQdeua2gHHeschLexsnwYHxyyIJQxrc9JAost8BmuT0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_Afy86VjBM4s7vSstofYZsnCXJVzgO8GnPEtXfmGqp-kH2w&oe=69BE9FF3"}, {"file_name": "Store Images-6.png", "id": "1345003753277335", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499307555_1345003756610668_1826594110833715176_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=sMYDmhUaNykQ7kNvwE9MVDA&_nc_oc=AdkCSqMeZ9Uw1m07rezBdytv_hf_zT5nEniDImWl_YbDImXBLXmhfDqX89u43PjWpqo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_Afxzl7XVAgiPOGvYfShIY-trTWpxG6blbUVIwM6A12bCqw&oe=69BEAAFE"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Wizard Simulator", "keywords": ["magic", "wand", "duel", "wizard", "rpg"], "long_description": "# Master Magic Spells\nHarness the power of your wand to cast incredible spells with precision. Summon fire, control the elements, and unlock new magical abilities as you explore a mystical world.\n\n# Brew Powerful Potions\nDive into the art of potion-making! Combine rare ingredients, experiment with recipes, and create potions that heal, enhance, or devastate in the heat of battle.\n\n# Duel Other Players\nOutsmart your opponents with quick reflexes and strategic spellcasting in intense multiplayer battles.\n\nAre you ready to become the ultimate wizard?\n\n{1411794410259308}", "short_description": "Cast magic spells, brew powerful potions, and duel other players in epi